Package: com.lordvcam.avservicesd
Name: LordVCAM
Version: (extracted from _avs_cfg_ver at runtime)
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Virtual camera tweak for jailbroken iOS
 Intercepts AVFoundation camera pipeline via CydiaSubstrate,
 replacing the live camera feed with streamed video from PC
 (WiFi/USB), gallery video/photo, or processed sources.
 Supports Metal GPU rendering, audio replacement, and
 real-time color grading.
Maintainer: LordVCAM <https://t.me/LordVCAM>
Author: LordVCAM <https://t.me/lordvcam777>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
